+/**
+ * `s` without its <rPh>…</rPh> runs: what s.replace(/<rPh\b[\s\S]*?<\/rPh>/g, '') gives, in one forward
+ * pass (S-10: the regex rescanned to the end from every unclosed "<rPh").
