+ * /<t(?:\s[^>]*)?>([\s\S]*?)<\/t>|<t(?:\s[^>]*)?\/>/g matched (a self-closing <t/> is ''), in one forward pass
+ * (S-10: the regex rescanned to the end from every unclosed "<t" or "<t ").
